{
  "name": "through-one-point",
  "type": "hyperframes:block",
  "title": "光没拐弯，像怎么倒了？",
  "description": "27秒小孔成像科普：用三维茶壶、暗箱剖面、被箱壁挡住的偏轴光线与穿孔直线光路，解释上下与左右倒像。均匀介质几何光学示意，非等比例，不模拟衍射与曝光。原创音效与中文图示。来源：ANU Make a pinhole camera https://science.anu.edu.au/engagement/science-lab-experiments-home-school/make-pinhole-camera；MIT Vision Book https://visionbook.mit.edu/imaging.html；详见 SOURCES.md。",
